{"unit_id":"Solicide__dsh-snake#card-zh","repo":"Solicide/dsh-snake","commit":"522a5ab15181043455c37f8af339770f76d76c11","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snake 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的贪吃鲸小游戏插件。它通过客户端模块在 DSH 页面背景绘制全屏棋盘，并在浮层和侧栏底部加入游戏控制入口。玩家可以开始、暂停、继续和重开游戏，用方向键转向，吃到 Token 后得分，撞墙或撞到自身则结束；棋盘会根据视口尺寸调整。控制面板支持中英文界面，最高分和面板位置保存在浏览器本地。适合希望在浏览 DSH 时玩轻量小游戏的用户，安装命令见 README。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:327-350","lib/client.js:1064-1079","lib/game.js:106-166"]}
{"unit_id":"Solicide__dsh-snake#card-en","repo":"Solicide/dsh-snake","commit":"522a5ab15181043455c37f8af339770f76d76c11","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-snake is a Snake game for DSH Web. It draws a full-screen board behind the interface, with controls in an overlay and sidebar. Use arrow keys to steer, eat tokens to score, and start, pause, resume, or retry. The board adapts to the viewport; best score and panel position are saved locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:327-350","lib/client.js:1064-1079","lib/game.js:106-166"]}
