{"unit_id":"Solicide__dsh-snake#feature-1","repo":"Solicide/dsh-snake","commit":"522a5ab15181043455c37f8af339770f76d76c11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snake 的功能「背景贪吃鲸」：在 DSH 页面绘制全屏棋盘、鲸鱼和 Token，画布作为背景显示。游戏随窗口尺寸重绘，空闲时会按视口重新计算棋盘格数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:327-350","lib/client.js:714-729"]}
